# Lab-only / unreferenced heavy assets — excluded from the Vercel deploy
# (2026-07-14 perf pass, ~33 MB). The files STAY in public/ so dev labs
# keep working locally; the routes that reference them are (internal)
# test pages, which `proxy.ts` blocks in production anyway.
#
# Verified before listing (grep app/ components/ lib/ prototypes):
# - gateway-hero.png      -> (internal) /test/gateway + /test/key-visual-portal only
# - env/ (studio.hdr)     -> (internal) /test/brandmark-reflective only
# - showcase/             -> zero references anywhere in the tree
#
# ⚠ Vince-4.jpg WAS listed here on the same "zero references" ground, and
# ADR-082 made that false: `lib/voidwalker/characterEras.ts` points two of
# the six eras at it, so the exclusion shipped two broken images to
# production while everything looked correct locally. Un-ignored 2026-08-26.
# It is 4.26 MB against the registry's own <=240 KB still budget, so it is a
# STOPGAP: it goes away when the real `public/images/voidwalker/era-<id>.jpg`
# plates land and the six `stillPath`s flip. A "zero references" claim is
# only true on the day it is written.
#
# Deliberately KEPT deployed:
# - public/videos/        -> /claude-workshop (PUBLIC marketing route) ships
#                            the key-visual video + poster
# - public/images/gateway/ -> /orrery gateway lab is ADMIN (prod-reachable)
public/images/gateway-hero.png
public/env
public/showcase
# - proof-lab/            -> (internal) /test/proof-highlight-lab only; the
#                            captured Arc-sphere still each direction dresses
#                            (regenerate with scripts/capture-proof-sphere.mjs)
public/proof-lab
# - dossier-lab/          -> (internal) /test/proof-dossier-lab only; the
#                            captured parked-mark still the dossier floats over
#                            (regenerate with scripts/capture-dossier-mark.mjs)
public/dossier-lab

# Documentation + decision records — never imported by the app, but they
# were being uploaded with every deploy (docs/ ~31 MB, mostly design
# mockups + inspiration imagery; sentinel/ ~10 MB of ADRs + baselines).
# Excluded 2026-07-23 alongside the docs consolidation.
docs
sentinel

# - portfolio-prototype.html -> a design prototype of /arcs/portfolio, kept in
#                              public/ so it serves at localhost during review.
#                              NOT deployed: it is client work on a page ADR-078
#                              frames as unlisted, and public/ is world-fetchable.
public/prototypes/portfolio-prototype.html
